The root cause of the issue is that the following configuration is missing from the Nginx config file located at:
https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-platform/blob/main/airbyte-webapp/nginx/default.conf.template

```
location /api/v1/connector_builder/ {
    fastcgi_read_timeout 1h;
    proxy_read_timeout 1h;
    client_max_body_size 200M;
    proxy_pass http://connector-builder-server/api/v1/connector_builder/;

    # Unset X-Airbyte-Auth header so that it cannot be used by external requests for authentication
    proxy_set_header X-Airbyte-Auth "";
}
```

The temporary solution is to modify the Nginx configuration file /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf in the airbyte-webapp container by adding the above configuration.

